[Verse]
Soothed, frozen, tired and sore
In the morning haze
Devastated, bleached away,
United in the flesh
And I’ll do it again,
I know it for sure

[Chorus]
And I am speeding And I am alive
And I am speeding And I am alive
And I am speeding And I am alive

[Bridge]
grid: |: (1,2,3.) D . E . | D | (4.) D . E . | F# :|

[Verse]
Luckily my eyes told (me)
Where my treasure was
